# Biome vcs.useIgnoreFile reads .gitignore and .ignore.
# Vercel CLI omits .gitignore from uploads, so this file must stay committed.
# See https://vercel.com/docs/deployments/build-features#ignored-files-and-folders
# and https://biomejs.dev/guides/integrate-in-vcs/

